# Deletion concept

Structured according to DIN 66398

| | |
|---|---|
| Organisation | Beispiel GmbH |
| Controller | Beispiel GmbH, Musterstraße 1, 10115 Berlin |
| Data protection officer | Erika Datenschutz, dsb@example.com |
| Version | 1.2 |
| As of | 2026-11-07 |

## 1. Purpose and scope

This deletion concept documents which personal data this application stores, how long it is kept, and how it is deleted, anonymised or restricted. It is generated from the same declarations the application enforces, so the document and the actual behaviour match. It covers the data in the application's database. It supports accountability under Art. 5 (2) GDPR and implements storage limitation under Art. 5 (1) (e) GDPR.

